      "message": "I think it makes sense that it passes. In the test you are passing None as dt_path, while in the real scenario it `/proc/device-tree/avf/reference` will be passed.\n\nIf you want to closely simulate the real scenario in the unit test, then I suggest using libfsfdt (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/android/virtmgr/fsfdt/) to create a fdt from some testdata like in this test (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/android/virtmgr/fsfdt/src/lib.rs;l\u003d123;drc\u003d63b67d750d13bf957e385abbca2bfc2411474f00).\n\nHaving said that, I\u0027m not sure it is worth the effort...",
