      "writtenOn": "2024-08-29T11:01:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That would be b/358078056, right?\n\nIn my mind, we would first merge this change, which will allow us to launch non-debuggable pVMs with microdroid vendor partition, and then we can work on removing dependency on device tree in our host code.\n\n\u003e IMO (but please feel free to disagree), Matt\u0027s time might be better spent on this kind of refactor than on integrating more stuff on top of the current implementation.\n\nThis patch doesn\u0027t integrate new stuff, it actually makes the `vendor_hashtree_descriptor_root_digest` property conditional on whether VM requested microdroid vendor partition, which brings us closer to the end goal of b/358078056 :)",
