      "message": "\u003e That would be b/358078056, right?\n\nThe refactor I\u0027m suggesting would be a step towards that, yes.\n\nTo be clear, I wasn\u0027t suggesting we block this CL on the refactor and completely agree that this code can go in. My comment above was replying to your suggestion of adding tests using `libfsfdt`, which seems to require some groundwork first. So I was agreeing with your\n\n\u003e Having said that, I\u0027m not sure it is worth the effort...\n\nbecause if we\u0027re going to refactor `create_device_tree_overlay()` to remove the direct read to the sysfs, why bother integrating `libfsfdt` here?",
